Program Version,EnergyPlus, Version 22.2.0-c249759bad, YMD=2026.09.17 16:52
! This file shows details about the branches, nodes, and other
! elements of the flow connections.
! This file is intended for use in "debugging" potential problems
! that may also be detected by the program, but may be more easily
! identified by "eye".
! This file is also intended to support software which draws a
! schematic diagram of the HVAC system.
! ===============================================================
! #Nodes,<Number of Unique Nodes>
 #Nodes,15
! <Node>,<NodeNumber>,<Node Name>,<Node Fluid Type>,<# Times Node Referenced After Definition>
 Node,1,DXVAV SYS 1 COOLING COIL OUTLET,Air,7
 Node,2,DXVAV SYS 1 MIXED AIR OUTLET,Air,7
 Node,3,DXVAV SYS 1 AIR LOOP INLET,Air,2
 Node,4,DXVAV SYS 1 RETURN FAN OUTLET,Air,4
 Node,5,DXVAV SYS 1 HEATING COIL OUTLET,Air,7
 Node,6,DXVAV SYS 1 SUPPLY FAN OUTLET,Air,6
 Node,7,THERMAL ZONE: SPACE 101 ZONE AIR NODE,Air,0
 Node,8,THERMAL ZONE: SPACE 101 SUPPLY INLET,Air,3
 Node,9,THERMAL ZONE: SPACE 101 RETURN OUTLET,Air,1
 Node,10,DXVAV SYS 1 SUPPLY PATH INLET,Air,4
 Node,11,DXVAV SYS 1 RETURN AIR OUTLET,Air,2
 Node,12,DXVAV SYS 1 OUTSIDE AIR INLET,Air,2
 Node,13,THERMAL ZONE: SPACE 101 ZONE EQUIP INLET,Air,1
 Node,14,THERMAL ZONE: SPACE 101 DAMPER OUTLET,Air,1
 Node,15,DXVAV SYS 1 RELIEF AIR OUTLET,Air,1
! ===============================================================
! Suspicious nodes have 0 references.  It is normal for some nodes, however.
! Listing nodes with 0 references (culled from previous list):
! <Suspicious Node>,<NodeNumber>,<Node Name>,<Node Fluid Type>,<# Times Node Referenced After Definition>
 Suspicious Node,7,THERMAL ZONE: SPACE 101 ZONE AIR NODE,Air,0
! ===============================================================
! <#Branch Lists>,<Number of Branch Lists>
 #Branch Lists,1
! <Branch List>,<Branch List Count>,<Branch List Name>,<Loop Name>,<Loop Type>,<Number of Branches>
! <Branch>,<Branch Count>,<Branch Name>,<Loop Name>,<Loop Type>,<Branch Inlet Node Name>,<Branch Outlet Node Name>
 Branch List,1,DXVAV SYS 1 BRANCHES,DXVAV SYS 1,Air,1
   Branch,1,DXVAV SYS 1 MAIN BRANCH,DXVAV SYS 1,Air,DXVAV SYS 1 AIR LOOP INLET,DXVAV SYS 1 SUPPLY FAN OUTLET
! ===============================================================
