! <#Outlet Nodes on Supply Air Path Component>,<Number of Nodes>
! <Supply Air Path Component Nodes>,<Node Count>,<Component Type>,<Component Name>,<Inlet Node Name>,<Outlet Node Name>,<AirLoopHVAC Name>
 Supply Air Path,1,DXVAV SYS 1 SUPPLY PATH,DXVAV SYS 1
   #Components on Supply Air Path,1
   Supply Air Path Component,1,AIRLOOPHVAC:ZONESPLITTER,DXVAV SYS 1 ZONE SPLITTER,DXVAV SYS 1
     #Outlet Nodes on Supply Air Path Component,1
     Supply Air Path Component Nodes,1,AIRLOOPHVAC:ZONESPLITTER,DXVAV SYS 1 ZONE SPLITTER,DXVAV SYS 1 SUPPLY PATH INLET,THERMAL ZONE: SPACE 101 ZONE EQUIP INLET,DXVAV SYS 1
! <#Nodes on Supply Air Path>,<Number of Nodes>
! <Supply Air Path Node>,<Node Type>,<Node Count>,<Node Name>,<AirLoopHVAC Name>
#Nodes on Supply Air Path,2
   Supply Air Path Node,Inlet Node,1,DXVAV SYS 1 SUPPLY PATH INLET,DXVAV SYS 1
   Supply Air Path Node,Outlet Node,2,THERMAL ZONE: SPACE 101 ZONE EQUIP INLET,DXVAV SYS 1
! ===============================================================
! <#Return Air Paths>,<Number of Return Air Paths>
